exhaustion. In general, when there is a possibility of narrow vs wide
meaning, Lojban tends to go with the wide meaning, because it's
usually easear to narrow down than to widen. It's not as if the mental
sense of tiredness is completely unrelated to the physical sense.

So what would you suggest for "she was beginning to get tired of
sitting there doing nothing"?

